# GMS shortens the wait by defeating enemies after a revival. This game has no
# window to count kills in, so the hyper simply pays the seconds -- 150 off a
# pact that walks 1103 down to 900, which is a sixth of the wait at master
# level.
name: "Final Pact - Reduce Cooldown"
skill_order: 8
description: "Reduces the time you must wait between one revival and the next."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_DARK_KNIGHT
hyper: true
required_level: 165
max_level: 1
base { revive_cooldown_cut_seconds: 150 }
